SpireZero includes code adapted from third-party projects.

spire-mentor (sts2-rs), https://github.com/tfriedel/spire-mentor, by Thomas Friedel (MIT)
  crates/sts2-core/src/run/map/segments.rs is adapted from spire-mentor's
  `SegmentIndex` (sts2-rs/crates/sts2-core/src/map_path_pruning.rs): the incremental
  duplicate-segment search of map pruning (candidates found once per pruning loop and
  re-checked after each prune; the path ranks and aliveness bitset were replaced in PF7).

