sts2-cli, https://github.com/morefreeze/sts2-cli, by Hao Wu (MIT)
  The referee (referee/) patches and builds on sts2-cli, a headless runner of the game.
  It is cloned by referee/setup.sh and is not part of this repository.

Godot Engine, https://godotengine.org (MIT)
  referee/stubs/Mathf.cs re-implements the API of Godot's `Mathf` (GodotSharp) so the
  game's code runs headless; the signatures follow Godot's.
